Modul: core-state
Test: ch.brickinventoryapp.state.RenderingAndTrustTest
Rot: without a known CA only the typed fingerprint counts, discarding remembers nothing

diff --git a/Android-App/core-security/src/main/java/ch/brickinventoryapp/security/ServerTrust.kt b/Android-App/core-security/src/main/java/ch/brickinventoryapp/security/ServerTrust.kt
